        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you'll play as the Harry and Larry brothers, two twin 9-year-old's who are on their quest to complete the annual Grocery Run event and win its grand prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUT YOUR REFLEXES TO THE TEST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fly through 24 colorful grocery aisle levels that get progressively faster and harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dodge hazardous obstacles scattered throughout including fish crates, ladders, snowballs, and more - this isn't your ordinary grocery store outing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Collect tasty treats such as fruit, candy, and, yes, even vegetables because Mom said we need more fiber in our diet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER NEW ABILITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Get temporary invincibility and knock back those pesky fish crates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Grab a shield for one-time protection against hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Bounce off bumpers to reach extra treats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fly through speed-up and speed-down chambers to change your speed (and the music tempo).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIMPLE CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Use your mouse to move Harry and Larry up and down, while they automatically fly forward.</p>",
